OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fmostly clear skies, leading to a
OL,7,Fchilly night. Cloud likely to build
OL,8,Ffrom the north and west towards dawn
OL,9,Fbut staying dry. Winds light.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FA bright start for most, but
OL,12,Fsoon becoming cloudy with outbreaks of
OL,13,Fpatchy rain, these generally confined
OL,14,Fto the northern Pennines, with
OL,15,Fbrighter spells in the southeast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
